{"id": "2937893", "name": "מציאת מד\"ר בעלת מקדמים קבועים מסדר מינימלי לפתרון x^n·cos(ax)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p></p><p></p><p>נתונה פונקציה</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</p><p>מצאו מד\"ר הומוגנית עם מקדמים קבועים מהצורה</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(y^{(n)}+a_{n-1}\\cdot y^{(n-1)}+\\cdots +a_1\\cdot y' +a_0\\cdot y=0\\)<br></p><p>מסדר הכי נמוך שניתן כך שהפונקציה היא פתרון של מד\"ר זו.</p><p>1) סדר המד\"ר הוא</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(n= \\)[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p><p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\">2) מצאו את המקדמים, הזינו אותם ברשימה (כלומר בין סוגריים מרובעים) - שימו לב לסדר המקדמים בהזנה שלכם:</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\([a_0,a_1,\\dots ,a_{n-1}] = \\)[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]]</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\"></p><p></p>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 35, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "[?,?,...]", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct_deg: is(ans1 = 2*n+2);\nN:length(ans2);\node:sum(ans2[k]*'diff(y,x,k-1), k,1,N)+'diff(y,x,N)=0;\nsa1:subst(y=yp,ode);\nsa2:ev(sa1,nouns);\nsa3:trigsimp(fullratsimp(expand(radcan(sa2))));\ncorrect_ode: is(sa3);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correct_deg", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">סדר המד\"ר נכון</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">סדר המד\"ר שגוי<br></p>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correct_ode", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">צדקת במד\"ר</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">טעית במד\"ר<br></p>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "char_poly", "cofs", "n", "yp"], "nvariants": 24}